WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.569
The cathode is the negative side of the x-ray tube.

2
00:00:04.569 --> 00:00:12.337
Its heated filament releases electrons by thermionic emission, and the focusing cup directs them toward the target.

3
00:00:12.337 --> 00:00:15.078
The anode is the positive side.

4
00:00:15.078 --> 00:00:23.760
It receives the electrons at the focal spot, where most energy becomes heat and a small amount becomes x-rays.
